Done. `/work/submission.csv` is written (296302 rows, ids and columns matching sample_submission.csv).

**Approach:** LightGBM classifier with engineered features (screen-time ratios, notifications/opens per hour, sleep deficit, categorical interaction terms), categorical columns passed natively to LightGBM. 5-fold stratified CV AUC = **0.96345 ± 0.00058**. Optuna tuning was abandoned — too slow (~3.5 min/trial) with marginal gains (best trial 0.9631 < baseline 0.9634). Final model retrained on all 691k training rows; test predictions are well-distributed (mean 0.7096, close to train label mean 0.7094), beating the constant baseline submission.
